 result←object dirty arg;was
 was←object ⎕VGET⊂'_dirty' 0 ⍝?object ##.##.∆WG'Dirty'
 :If 0=≢arg
     result←was
 :Else
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: dirty'##.##.Error~##.##.IsInt arg
     '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: dirty'##.##.Error(1≠≢arg)∨~0 1∊⍨≢⍴arg
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: dirty'##.##.Error~arg⊃⍛∊0 1
     :If (1=arg)∧0=was ⍝ It can only be turned on, not off
         object ##.##.∆WG'Dirty' 1
         object._dirty←1
     :EndIf
 :EndIf
